es and technologies. In addition, the company offers metrology and inspection systems, including YieldStar optical metrology systems, a diffraction-based wafer metrology platform to assess the quality of patterns on the wafers; and HMI electron beam solutions to locate and analyze individual chip defects. Further, it provides computational lithography solutions, and lithography systems and control software solutions; and refurbishes and upgrades lithography systems, as well as offers customer support and related services. Additionally, the company offers hardware, software, and services to chipmakers to produce the patterns of integrated circuits. It operates in Japan, South Korea, Singapore, Taiwan, China, rest of Asia, the Netherlands, rest of Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the United States. The company was formerly known as ASM Lithography Holding N.V. and changed its name to ASML Holding N.V. in 2001. ASML Holding N.V. was founded in 1984 and is headquartered in Veldhoven, the Netherlands.","employees":44681,"website":"https://www.asml.com","country":"Netherlands","city":"Veldhoven","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Christophe D. Fouquet","title":"President, CEO and Chair of the Board of Management"},{"name":"Mr. Roger J. M. Dassen Ph.D.","title":"Executive VP, CFO & Member of the Management Board"},{"name":"Mr. Frederic J. M. Schneider-Maunoury","title":"Executive VP, COO & Member of the Management Board"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":18.39,"tpe":32.71,"ps":6.516,"pfcf":32.14,"peg":1.005,"pb":7.933,"rev_growth":0.215,"eps_growth":0.4515,"eps_growth_fwd":0.2552,"eps_growth_next":0.1933,"div_yield":0.0011,"roe":0.2323,"roa":0.07977,"de":47.91,"gross_margin":0.5924,"op_margin":0.225,"profit_margin":0.1914,"current_ratio":1.554},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":25.02,"sector":18.39,"pct":24,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":38.68,"sector":32.71,"pct":39,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":13.69,"sector